# LLM Wiki

This project's Obsidian vault is **`mckenna-derby wiki/`** (repository folder name + space + `wiki`).

Before creating, updating, or querying wiki pages, read `mckenna-derby wiki/SCHEMA.md` for conventions.

The vault uses `[[wikilinks]]` for internal links. Every page has YAML frontmatter.

When the user says "ingest", "add to wiki", "lint wiki", or "query wiki", follow the workflows in SCHEMA.md (and the global **llm-wiki** skill when applicable).

After significant work sessions, suggest filing key decisions and learnings into the wiki.
